Subject: [PATCH] Make the later evolutions of the roster reachable

Primeape evolves into Annihilape at level 40 and Stantler into Wyrdeer
when it knows Psyshield Bash, which it now learns at level 31; the
method hg-engine lists for both is not implemented. The Goldenrod shop
sells the Black Augurite, and the Peat Block with seven badges.
Generated by tools/hack/later_evos.py.
